    question: 'Is Notion better than Obsidian?',
    answer: '<strong>Notion</strong> is better for teams, databases, and project management with a beautiful interface and cloud sync. <strong>Obsidian</strong> is better for personal knowledge management, linking ideas, and offline-first workflows - plus your notes are stored as plain text files you own. Choose Notion for collaboration and structure, Obsidian for thinking and linking ideas.'
  },
