    question: 'Can I use Obsidian for free?',
    answer: 'Yes, <strong>Obsidian</strong> is completely free for personal use. Your notes are stored locally on your devices as plain Markdown files. However, if you want cloud sync across devices, you need <strong>Obsidian Sync</strong> ($10/mo) or you can use third-party sync services like iCloud, Dropbox, or Syncthing. Publish (website hosting) is $8/mo extra.'
  },
